The tester was blocked all night: no free slot was left in the eight blocks
(ops 06:46Z). Misho, 9 Oct: the numbers are ours to decide. The next block in
the same series is added — Ofcom's Leicester geographic range reserved for
drama, 1,000 slots, checked exactly like the others (prefix, digit count,
bounds). It comes last, so the seats already made keep their numbers and new
seats take the first free slot as before.

